# CODEOWNERS for axolotl-community-plugins
#
# NOTE: the teams below are PLACEHOLDERS. Replace them with the real GitHub
# teams once the registry is homed under axolotl-ai-cloud. The point of this
# file is the review *policy*, not the specific handles.
#
# For the security-critical paths to actually require sign-off, pair this file
# with a branch-protection rule that enables "Require review from Code Owners".

# --- Default: lighter-touch review for the client, scripts, rules, and docs ---
*                       @axolotl-ai-cloud/maintainers

# --- Security-critical: every listing and every scanner waiver is a trust
#     decision and must be reviewed by the plugin reviewers. ---
/registry/              @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers
/waivers/               @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers

# The scan rules and scan/stamp scripts define what "vetted" means, so changes
# to them are trust decisions too.
/rules/                 @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers
/scripts/run_scans.py   @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers
/scripts/run_plugin_checks.py  @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers
/scripts/validate_entry.py     @axolotl-ai-cloud/plugin-reviewers
